become reality. HOWEVER . . .

. . . Cavemen get the rawest deal in the game.  They start out with
_no_ intrinsics, and pathetic equipment.  They are idiots, and no
longer even start with good strength dexterity and constitution. (The
starting STR, CON and DEX stats of samurai have increased however)
Lastly, their quest artifact blows chunks.  Their only benefit
nowadays is being able to get Excaliber (as all Lawfuls can) early on,
but only if they are fortunate enough to find a long sword early on.

I have a way to make up for this, a simple way to repay the caveman
for all his years of devotion.  Have Tiamat leave behind Chromatic
Dragon Scale Mail.  Allow it to have the abilities of all the dragon
scale mails.  You can make it poisonous and sickening to put on and
treat it like an artifact in order to prevent people from wishing for
it early on.

